    <td colspan="2" style="font-weight: bold; text-align: center; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid">Capital<br/> Expenditure<br/> on CIP</td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; font-weight: bold">&#160;</td></tr>
