  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
    <td style="text-align: left">2026</td><td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="text-align: right"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c120" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="upc:FutureMinimumCapitalExpenditureTwoYears" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-6112">8,697,700</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="text-align: left">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <td style="text-align: left; padding-bottom: 1.5pt">2027</td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt">&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: right"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c120" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="upc:FutureMinimumCapitalExpenditureThreeYears" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-6113">1,142,612</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; text-align: left">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
    <td style="text-align: left; padding-bottom: 4pt">Total</td><td style="padding-bottom: 4pt">&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 4pt double; text-align: left">$</td><td style="border-bottom: Black 4pt double; text-align: right"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c120" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="upc:CapitalExpenditureNet" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-6114">13,268,147</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="padding-bottom: 4pt; text-align: left">&#160;</td></tr>
  </table></ix:continuation></ix:continuation><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

</div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="upc:PrepaymentForPurchaseOfAPropertyTextBlock" id="ixv-4252"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="background-color: white"><b>NOTE
11 &#8212; PREPAYMENT FOR PURCHASE OF A PROPERTY</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="background-color: white">On
May 6, 2021, the Company entered into a real estate property purchase agreement with related party Jiangxi Yueshang Investment Co., Ltd.
(&#8220;Jiangxi Yueshang&#8221;), an entity in which the Company&#8217;s chief executive officer, Mr. Gang Lai, owned <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c121" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-6115">5</ix:nonFraction>% equity interest
as of the date of that agreement. Pursuant to the property purchase agreement, Jiangxi Yueshang will sell and the Company will purchase
a certain residential apartment and commercial office space totaling <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c122" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AreaOfRealEstateProperty" scale="0" unitRef="sqm" id="ixv-6116">2,749.30</ix:nonFraction> square meters, with a total purchase price of RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c123" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SupplementalDeferredPurchasePrice" scale="6" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-6117">32</ix:nonFraction> million
(approximately $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c123" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SupplementalDeferredPurchasePrice" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-6118">4.4</ix:nonFraction> million). Pursuant to this agreement, the Company was required to make a prepayment in the amount of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c124" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="upc:PercentageOfPrepayment" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-6119">50</ix:nonFraction>% of the total
purchase price, with <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c122" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationPercentage" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-6120">20</ix:nonFraction>% of the total purchase price payable upon the availability of a certificate of occupancy, and <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c125" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="upc:PayableDeliveryPropertyPercentage" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-6121">30</ix:nonFraction>% of the total
purchase price payable upon delivery of the property.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="background-color: white">As
of March 31, 2024, the Company had made a prepayment of RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c126" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PrepaymentFeesOnAdvancesNet" scale="6" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-6122">16</ix:nonFraction> million (approximately $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c126" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PrepaymentFeesOnAdvancesNet" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-6123">2.2</ix:nonFraction> million) to Jiangxi Yueshang. The remaining
balance is expected to be paid by April 2025. Since the property is located in the urban downtown area of Ji&#8217;an City, the Company
plans to use the property for offices in June 2025.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><b>&#160;</b></p><div>

</div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_ShortTermDebtTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="us-gaap:ShortTermDebtTextBlock" id="ixv-4267"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="background-color: white"><b>NOTE
12 &#8212; SHORT-TERM BANK LOANS</b></span></p>

