  </table></ix:continuation>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">As of September 30, 2023, the balance due from
related parties consisted of advanced funds to the Company&#8217;s director and general manager, Mr. Yajun Hu. These advances are non-interest
bearing and fully repaid on October 12, 2023.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="upc_ScheduleOfDueToRelatedPartiessTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="upc:ScheduleOfDueToRelatedPartiessTableTextBlock" id="ixv-4629"><span style="background-color: white"><b>(c) Due to related parties</b></span></ix:nonNumeric></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<ix:continuation id="upc_ScheduleOfDueToRelatedPartiessTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">
